// Source: https://github.com/CyberShiv-AI/ai-cyber-threat-detections
// Collected: 2026-06-11
// KQL Library - https://github.com/sivolko/kql-library

SigninLogs
| where ConditionalAccessStatus == "failure"
| summarize FailedAttempts = count() by UserPrincipalName, bin(TimeGenerated, 1h)
| where FailedAttempts > 5
